{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Chart Cue - PDF Viewer for REAPER. Shows PDF charts and scrolls them with markers, cue lists, MIDI CC, mouse wheel or dragging; 1 or 2 PDFs per song. Windows only. Requires: the free ReaImGui extension. Install it first: Extensions > ReaPack > Browse packages > "ReaImGui" > Install, then restart REAPER.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 MIDI Pilot - write the MIDI for a Neural DSP Quad Cortex / Quad Cortex mini or a Line 6 Helix, HX Stomp, HX Stomp XL or HX Effects in REAPER: presets at the song starts, scenes (snapshots) by name, knob values in real units, nudges and ramps. The MIDI plays without the script. Requires: the free ReaImGui extension (ReaPack).\par}
}

version.changelog:
The Quad Cortex scene colours (the scene that plays in full colour); double-click opens REAPER's MIDI editor there.
A calmer Songs page ('Set up songs', Tools and Clear menus, cards); consistent forms; Settings in sections;
formatted Help topics; darker panels and a Light / Dark theme (Settings > General > Theme).

